WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.720
Microsoft Fabric is an architectural

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:04.720
attempt to bring the entire historically

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:07.399
fragmented data workflow into one unified

00:00:07.279 --> 00:00:08.979
software as a service platform.

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:10.780
And when we say workflow, we

00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:12.739
mean everything. The complete life

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:14.959
cycle. Ingesting data from external

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:17.100
sources, transforming and cleaning

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:20.600
it, analyzing historical batches, real

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:23.180
-time IOT information, training machine

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:24.940
learning models, and finally serving

00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:26.600
up the visualizations in reporting

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:27.000
tools.
